n-osx&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792369288575000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1cbywZjo4nOQgU3w5Exovo\">http://stackoverflow.com/<u></u>questions/17218305/tiff-<u></u>resolution-and-compression-<u></u>are-not-reliably-set-in-osx</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;m on a mac so this makes sense for me: </div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\" size=\"1\">#creation of dataset and plot</font></div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\" size=\"1\">df&lt;-data.frame(x=1:10, y=1:10)<br>ggplot(data=df, aes(x=x, y=y))+geom_point()<br>#170 MB file<br>ggsave(&quot;compressed.not.tiff&quot;, plot = last_plot(), width = 8.5, height = 5, units = &quot;in&quot;, pointsize = 12, dpi=1000)<br># 443 kB file<br>ggsave(&quot;compressed.is.tiff&quot;, plot = last_plot(), width = 8.5, height = 5, units = &quot;in&quot;, pointsize = 12, dpi=1000, compression=&quot;lzw&quot;, type=&quot;cairo&quot;)</font><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\" size=\"1\"><br></font></div>I don&#39;t have a windows or Linux machine so I&#39;m unsure how useful this will be for you. <div><br></div><div>B</div></div>\r\n</blockquote></div></div></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br><div><div>\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the ggplot2 mailing list.<br>\r\nPlease provide a reproducible example: <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792369288575000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ROPe46-JV5mbWzvr2TZMh\">https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility</a><br>\r\n <br>\r\nTo post: email <a rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nTo unsubscribe: email <a rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nMore options: <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&a